WEBVTT

13:00.730 --> 13:03.148
Andy's opening it.
He's really excited about this one.

13:03.232 --> 13:05.150
-Mom, what is it?
-It's a huge package.

13:05.234 --> 13:08.194
Oh, get outta the... One of the kids
is in the way. I can't see.

13:08.863 --> 13:11.239
-It's a...
-Wow!

13:13.242 --> 13:15.744
It's a what? What is it?

13:17.246 --> 13:18.663
-Oh, no!
-Oh, ya big lizard!

13:18.748 --> 13:21.374
-Now we'll never know what it is!
-Way to go, Rex!

13:21.459 --> 13:23.418
No, no! Turn 'em around!
Turn 'em around!

13:23.502 --> 13:26.004
He's puttin' 'em in backwa...
Here, you're puttin' 'em in backwards!

13:26.088 --> 13:29.215
Plus is positive, minus is negative!
Oh, let me!
